<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head', { page: 'terms' }) %>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css?v=<%= assetV %>">
</head>
<body>
<%- include('partials/announcement') %>
<%- include('partials/nav', { active: '' }) %>

<section style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#000 0%,#001a3a 60%,#000 100%);padding:4rem 2rem 3rem;text-align:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden;">
  <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,rgba(0,112,209,0.12) 0%,transparent 65%);pointer-events:none;"></div>
  <div style="position:relative;z-index:1;">
    <div style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;background:rgba(0,112,209,0.15);border:1px solid rgba(0,112,209,0.3);border-radius:20px;padding:0.35rem 1rem;font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--ps-blue);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:1.25rem;">PlayStation Hub · Philippines</div>
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3rem);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-1px;margin-bottom:1rem;">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:1rem;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;">The rental rules for playstation-hub.com. The step-by-step is on <a href="/how-it-works" style="color:var(--ps-blue);">How It Works</a>. Questions are on the <a href="/faq" style="color:var(--ps-blue);">FAQ</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;padding:3rem 2rem 4rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem;">
  <section style="background:#0d0d0d;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.4rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 0.45rem;">Who this covers</h2>
    <p style="margin:0;color:#aaa;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.65;">PlayStation Hub rents and sells PS4 and PS5 digital games in the Philippines through playstation-hub.com, the Facebook Page, and Messenger. Ordering on the site, joining a waitlist, or messaging the Page means these terms apply. Privacy is on the <a href="/privacy" style="color:var(--ps-blue);">Privacy Policy</a>. How to ask us to delete your data is on <a href="/data-deletion" style="color:var(--ps-blue);">Data Deletion</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section style="background:#0d0d0d;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.4rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 0.45rem;">Rentals</h2>
    <p style="margin:0 0 0.6rem;color:#aaa;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.65;">A rental is Weekly (7 days) or Monthly (30 days). When the monthly promo is on, the default is 10% off the 30-day price, and checkout charges the price after that discount. You pick the game, the account type, and the length on the site. The price on the game page is the price for that order. You can extend a weekly or monthly rental at the same price you paid.</p>
    <p style="margin:0;color:#aaa;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.65;"><%- include('partials/swap-line') %> Swaps must be to a game in the same price tier. Swapping into a higher-priced game like GTA VI means paying the price difference.</p>
  </section>

  <% const termDep = (settings.promo && settings.promo.deposit != null) ? settings.promo.deposit : 100; %>
  <% const termLate = (settings.promo && settings.promo.late_fee_per_day != null) ? settings.promo.late_fee_per_day : 20; %>
  <section style="background:#0d0d0d;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.4rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 0.45rem;">Account types</h2>
    <p style="margin:0 0 0.6rem;color:#aaa;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.65;"><strong style="color:#fff;">Non-Trophy</strong> is the cheapest. Play happens on the shop account. There is no deposit.</p>
    <p style="margin:0 0 0.6rem;color:#aaa;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.65;"><strong style="color:#fff;">Trophy</strong> is your own profile. Trophies and saves stay with you. The price is higher than Non-Trophy, and there is a ₱<%= termDep %> refundable deposit.</p>
    <p style="margin:0;color:#aaa;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.65;"><strong style="color:#fff;">PS4 Primary</strong> is the Trophy-style account for games that support PS4. You play on your own profile, so trophies and saves stay with you. It costs the same as a PS5 Trophy rental, and the ₱<%= termDep %> refundable deposit applies.</p>
  </section>

  <section style="background:#0d0d0d;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.4rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 0.45rem;">Deposit and late fee</h2>
    <p style="margin:0 0 0.6rem;color:#aaa;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.65;">The ₱<%= termDep %> deposit on Trophy and PS4 Primary is refunded when the account is returned with proof. Sign our account out and send a screenshot of the signed-out account. Once we verify it, the deposit goes back the way you paid (GCash or Maya, or PayPal), which takes about a minute. Non-Trophy has no deposit. These amounts are the shop defaults in settings.</p>
    <p style="margin:0;color:#aaa;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.65;">Non-Trophy rentals have no late fees, because no deposit is collected. On Trophy and PS4 Primary, a late return costs ₱<%= termLate %> per late day, deducted from the ₱<%= termDep %> deposit. Return on time and the full deposit can be refunded. You can cancel and get your rental fee refunded only within 12 hours after your rental starts. It goes back the way you paid: GCash or Maya, or PayPal. After that, the rental fee can't be refunded.</p>
  </section>

  <section style="background:#0d0d0d;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.4rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 0.45rem;">Access</h2>
    <p style="margin:0;color:#aaa;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.65;">Access is through a console sign-in QR code. You send the code from your console, and the shop account signs in there. We never ask for your PSN password. Customers never share a password. <%= policy.ONLINE_WITHOUT %> <%= policy.ONLINE_EXCEPTION %> See <a href="/how-to-sign-in" style="color:var(--ps-blue);">How to Sign In</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section style="background:#0d0d0d;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.4rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 0.45rem;">Payment</h2>
    <p style="margin:0;color:#aaa;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.65;"><%- include('partials/pay-note').trim() %>. Local payment is a GCash or Maya QR, mostly via Messenger. International customers pay via PayPal. Card and QR Ph checkout, when it is switched on, is a PayMongo page. The site stores the order reference and the payment result, not your card number.</p>
  </section>

  <section style="background:#0d0d0d;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.4rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 0.45rem;">Bought games</h2>
    <p style="margin:0;color:#aaa;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.65;">Bought games are permanent. There is no return and no end date.</p>
  </section>

  <section style="background:#0d0d0d;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.4rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 0.45rem;">Sold out</h2>
    <p style="margin:0;color:#aaa;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.65;">Sold-out games have a free waitlist. You join from the game page and keep your place until a slot opens. You do not have to pay just to stay on that list.</p>
  </section>

  <section style="background:#0d0d0d;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.4rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 0.45rem;">Contact</h2>
    <p style="margin:0;color:#aaa;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.65;">Email <a href="mailto:playstationhub00@gmail.com" style="color:var(--ps-blue);">playstationhub00@gmail.com</a>, <a href="http://m.me/PlaystationHub00" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--ps-blue);">Messenger</a>, or <a href="https://facebook.com/PlaystationHub00" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--ps-blue);">Facebook</a>. Also see the <a href="/privacy" style="color:var(--ps-blue);">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/data-deletion" style="color:var(--ps-blue);">Data Deletion</a>.</p>
  </section>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
